# cgmr profiles for this repository's own gate (.:V1). Read by
# nix/guard/cgmr.sh through the nearest-.cgmr lookup; `cgmr profiles`
# lists them. Never `--when`: a project file may not run commands.

# Heavy pre-push steps (coverage, package): wait for room, and after ten
# minutes run anyway at background priority rather than block the push.
[heavy]
--load 1
--needs-mem 2GiB
--timeout 10m
--or-background
--heartbeat 30s
